      "Grade 4 · Term 4 PSW: healthy environment and personal health - home, school and community; examples of environments that are unhealthy such as pollution of air, water and land including illegal dumping sites; the dangers of unhealthy environments to personal health; strategies to keep environments healthy including conservation of the environment; and celebrating Arbor Day",
