      "Grade 4 · Term 2 Creative Arts: improvise and create - short rhythm patterns (crotchets, crotchet rests, minims and minim rests) using body percussion or percussion instruments; locomotor and non-locomotor movements individually and in unison in time to a beat with and without imagery; rhythm patterns combining locomotor movements with sound to walking, running and skipping note values; instruments made from found objects; and sound pictures on themes such as a thunderstorm or a train journey",
